      "scope": {
        "type": "module",
        "module": "pwm0_top"
      },
      "summary": "将输入handshake (i_drive/i_msg) 经过pwm_fifo1→pwm_fifo2后输出到o_drive/o_msg，同时处理自由容量信号以实现反压控制。",
      "subject": "两级FIFO流水线",
      "explanation": "事件流: i_drive→pwm_fifo1.i_drive, pwm_fifo1.o_driveNext→o_drive_in→pwm_fifo2.i_drive, pwm_fifo2.o_driveNext→o_drive。自由信号: i_free→pwm_fifo2.i_freeNext (下游容量反馈), pwm_fifo1.o_free→o_free (上游容量指示)。这样确保消息只在下游有空间且上游有数据时推进，形成两阶弹性缓冲区。",
      "signals": [
        "i_drive",
        "o_drive",
        "i_msg",
        "o_msg",
        "i_free",
        "o_free",
        "o_drive_in"
